r><ul class=breadcrumbs__list><li class=breadcrumbs__item><span class=breadcrumbs__link-wrap> <a class=breadcrumbs__link href="/" data-script=external-links>Home</a> <span class="zmdi zmdi-chevron-right icon" aria-hidden=true></span> </span><li class=breadcrumbs__item><span class=breadcrumbs__link-wrap> <a class=breadcrumbs__link href="/services/" data-script=external-links>Services</a> <span class="zmdi zmdi-chevron-right icon" aria-hidden=true></span> </span><li class=breadcrumbs__item><span class=breadcrumbs__link-wrap> <a class=breadcrumbs__link href="/services/securities/" data-script=external-links>Securities</a> <span class="zmdi zmdi-chevron-right icon" aria-hidden=true></span> </span><li class=breadcrumbs__item><span class="breadcrumbs__link-wrap breadcrumbs__link-wrap--active" aria-current=page>Natural Gas</span></ul></div></div><section class="global-banner global-banner--center-align section section--bg-secondary section--text-light"><picture class=global-banner__picture> <img loading=lazy class=global-banner__image src="/media/nxaaw30l/adobe-express-2025-10-13-105637.webp?width=2688&amp;height=700&amp;v=1dc3c27bd64e750&amp;format=webp" alt=""> </picture><div class=global-banner__overlay style=opacity:50%;background-color:#000000 aria-hidden=true></div><div class="wrap wrap--narrow"><div class=global-banner__content><h1 class="global-banner__title headline h1">Natural Gas &amp; JKM (Financial LNG)</h1><p class="global-banner__description body-text standfirst">OTC broking across Europe and Asia — transparent, efficient and client-specific</div></div></section><section class="two-column section section--text-dark section--bg-white"><div class="spacer spacer--medium" aria-hidden=true></div><div class=wrap><div class=two-column__wrap><div class=two-column__left><h2 class="h3 headline">Energy Risk Awards 2024 &#8211; Newcomer of the Year</h2></div><div class=two-column__right><div class=rte><div class="standfirst body-text"><p>Our Natural Gas &amp; JKM (Financial LNG) desk specialises in broking over-the-counter (OTC) wholesale energy products across Europe and Asia, with an emphasis on transparency, efficiency and client-specific solutions.<p>As energy markets evolve, LNG demand is growing, gas markets are transforming globally, and new opportunities are emerging. We help clients navigate this shift by providing access to European gas markets and global LNG derivatives, combining deep market expertise with smart technology to deliver a high-integrity, responsive execution service.</div></div></div></div></div><div class="spacer spacer--medium" aria-hidden=true></div></section><div class="statistics statistics--center section section--bg-light section--text-dark"><div class="spacer spacer--medium" aria-hidden=true></div><div class=wrap><div class=statistics__wrapper><div class=statistics__text-content><h2 class="statistics__title headline h3">Our desk in numbers</h2><div class="statistics__description body-text standfirst"><p>A specialist desk with strong regional presence, experienced brokers, broad product coverage and efficient post-trade support</div></div><div class=statistics__items-wrap><div class=statistics__items><div class=statistics__item><img class=statistics__icon src=/media/b5jcbfak/vessel-status.svg alt=""><p class="statistics__statistic h2">2<div class="statistics__item-title headline h6"><p>Global hubs</div><div class="statistics__item-description body-text text"><p>London &amp; Madrid. On-the-ground coverage for European gas and LNG markets.</div></div><div class=statistics__item><img class=statistics__icon src=/media/gplouklf/team.svg alt=""><p class="statistics__statistic h2">11<div class="statistics__item-title headline h6"><p>Brokers</div><div class="statistics__item-description body-text text"><p>OTC natural-gas and LNG (JKM) specialists across voice and screen execution.</div></div><div class=statistics__item><img class=statistics__icon src=/media/tukfnzzo/lng-2.svg alt=""><p class="statistics__statistic h2">12<div class="statistics__item-title headline h6"><p>Products traded</div><div class="statistics__item-description body-text text"><p>JKM, UKD, TFU, TTF, THE, NBP, PEG, VTP, PSV, ZTP, PVB, Czech</div></div><div class=statistics__item><img class=statistics__icon src=/media/3jbmw54k/contact.svg alt=""><p class="statistics__statistic h2">2<div class="statistics__item-title headline h6"><p>Operators</div><div class="statistics__item-description body-text text"><p>Post-trade support: matching, reconciliation, clearing workflows and REMIT reporting.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="spacer spacer--medium" aria-hidden=true></div></div><div class="proof-points proof-points--scrolled-overlap proof-points--scrolled-with-one-column proof-points--image section section--bg-white section--text-dark"><div class="spacer spacer--medium" aria-hidden=true></div><div class=wrap><div class=proof-points__wrapper><div class=proof-points__text-content><div class=proof-points__text-wrap><h2 class="proof-points__title headline h3">Our Services</h2></div></div><div class=proof-points__items-wrap><picture class="proof-points__image module-radius-md"><source media=(max-width:767px) srcset="/media/ujfjeryf/dscf4573.webp?width=328&amp;v=1dcc1c2f69a5d40&amp;format=webp"><img loading=lazy class="proof-points__img image" src="/media/ujfjeryf/dscf4573.webp?width=640&amp;v=1dcc1c2f69a5d40&amp;format=webp" alt=""> </picture><div class="proof-points__items proof-points__items--outlined proof-points__items--with-shadow js-proof-points-items" data-script=proof-points><div class="proof-points__item section section--bg-white section--text-dark module-radius-sm js-cta-card js-proof-points-card"><div class=proof-points__item-content><p class="proof-points__number headline h3">01<h4 class="proof-points__item-title headline h6">High-quality execution</h4><div class="proof-points__item-description body-text text rte"><div class="proof-points__item-description body-text text rte"><p class=MsoNormal>Voice and screen-based broking with live market intelligence; tight pricing and reliable workflows.</div></div></div></div><div class="proof-points__item section section--bg-white section--text-dark module-radius-sm js-cta-card js-proof-points-card"><div class=proof-points__item-content><p class="proof-points__number headline h3">02<h4 class="proof-points__item-title headline h6">Bespoke execution strategies</h4><div class="proof-points__item-description body-text text rte"><div class="proof-points__item-description body-text text rte"><p class=MsoNormal>Designed for larger or more complex orders requiring discretion — block/off-screen where appropriate.</div></div></div></div><div class="proof-points__item section section--bg-white section--text-dark module-radius-sm js-cta-card js-proof-points-card"><div class=proof-points__item-content><p class="proof-points__number headline h3">03<h4 class="proof-points__item-title headline h6">Full trade lifecycle support</h4><div class="proof-points__item-description body-text text rte"><div class="proof-points__item-description body-text text rte"><p class=MsoNormal>Straight-through processing, trade matching and reconciliation, plus REMIT reporting and compliance support.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="spacer spacer--medium" aria-hidden=true></div></div><div class="proof-points proof-points--carousel proof-points--stacked-left-aligned cta-cards section section--bg-light section--text-dark"><div class="spacer spacer--medium" aria-hidden=true></div><div class=wrap><div class=proof-points__wrapper><div class=proof-points__text-content><div class=proof-points__text-wrap><h2 class="proof-points__title headline h3">What Sets Us Apart</h2></div></div><div class=proof-points__items-wrap><div class="cta-cards__slider-wrap cta-cards__slider-wrap--carousel cta-cards__slider-wrap--mobile-carousel js-cards-carousel" data-script=cards-carousel><div class="cta-cards__slider splide" aria-label="Cards carousel"><div class="cta-cards__track splide__track"><ul class="cta-cards__list splide__list proof-points__items--outlined proof-points__items--with-shadow"><li class="cta-cards__slide splide__slide"><div class="proof-points__item section section--bg-white section--text-dark module-radius-sm js-cta-card js-proof-points-card"><div class=proof-points__item-content><img class=proof-points__icon src="/media/ss0jcszx/negotiation.svg?width=60&amp;height=60&amp;v=1dcb8662aa05d80" alt=""><h4 class="proof-points__item-title headline h6">Tailored Approach</h4><div class="proof-points__item-description body-text text rte"><p style=mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto class=MsoNormal><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:'Aptos',sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:'Aptos',sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA">We don’t believe in one-size-fits-all. Every client operates differently, so we adapt. Our brokers work closely with each customer to understand their specific goals and deliver personalised trade execution and advisory services.</span><br></span></div></div></div><li class="cta-cards__slide splide__slide"><div class="proof-points__item section section--bg-white section--text-dark module-radius-sm js-cta-card js-proof-points-card"><div class=proof-points__item-content><img class=proof-points__icon src="/media/nc5haokv/computer.svg?width=60&amp;height=60&amp;v=1dcb86627be4c30" alt=""><h4 class="proof-points__item-title headline h6">Technology & Integration</h4><div class="proof-points__item-description body-text text rte"><p><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:'Aptos',sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:'Times New Roman'">We use advanced, flexible systems to streamline operations, minimise errors, and adapt quickly to client needs. Our focus on continuous innovation ensures reliable, efficient support throughout the trade lifecycle.</span></div></div></div><li class="cta-cards__slide splide__slide"><div class="proof-points__item section section--bg-white section--text-dark module-radius-sm js-cta-card js-proof-points-card"><div class=proof-points__item-content><img class=proof-points__icon src="/media/rdhb0r4u/analysis-2.svg?width=60&amp;height=60&amp;v=1dcb86626daf110" alt=""><h4 class="proof-points__item-title headline h6">Deep Market Insight</h4><div class="proof-points__item-description body-text text rte"><p><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:'Aptos',sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA">Our team brings decades of experience in European energy markets. We provide voice-based and screen-based broking that is informed, discreet, and trusted by institutional participants across the sector.</span></div></div></div><li class="cta-cards__slide splide__slide"><div class="proof-points__item section section--bg-white section--text-dark module-radius-sm js-cta-card js-proof-points-card"><div class=proof-points__item-content><img class=proof-points__icon src="/media/352pu0e0/secure.svg?width=60&amp;height=60&amp;v=1dcb8662b566710" alt=""><h4 class="proof-points__item-title headline h6">Discreet, Large Volume Trading</h4><div class="proof-points__item-description body-text text rte"><p><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:'Aptos',sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA">We specialise in off-screen execution for larger-than-standard volumes, preserving anonymity while ensuring access to competitive pricing.</span></div></div></div><li class="cta-cards__slide splide__slide"><div class="proof-points__item section section--bg-white section--text-dark module-radius-sm js-cta-card js-proof-points-card"><div class=proof-points__item-content><img class=proof-points__icon src="/media/3jbmw54k/contact.svg?width=60&amp;height=60&amp;v=1dcb8662814d0a0" alt=""><h4 class="proof-points__item-title headline h6">Comprehensive Post-Trade Services</h4><div class="proof-points__item-description body-text text rte"><p><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:'Aptos',sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA">From trade matching and reconciliation to REMIT reporting, we handle the complexities so you can focus on the strategy.</span></div></div></div></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="spacer spacer--medium" aria-hidden=true></div></div><div class="text-block section section--bg-light section--text-dark"><div class="spacer spacer--extra-small" aria-hidden=true></div><div class=wrap><div class=rte data-script=rte><p style=text-align:center;color:#6e6e6e><em>This is a financial promotion issued by Braemar Securities Limited, FRN: 583277, Capital at Risk</em></div></div><div class="spacer spacer--extra-small" aria-hidden=true></div></div><section class="cta-block cta-block--image section section--text-light"><div class="cta-block__holder section section--bg-secondary"><div class=wrap><div class=cta-block__wrapper><div class=cta-block__text-content><h2 class="cta-block__title headline h2">Contact us</h2><div class="cta-block__description body-text standfirst">We’re more than just brokers, we’re market facilitators. Our mission is to optimise the value of every transaction through precision, speed, and discretion.</div><div class=cta-block__links-wrap><a class="btn btn--xxl btn--primary radius-sm" href="/contacts/natural-gas/" data-script=external-links> <span class="zmdi icon icon--btn-left" aria-hidden=true></span> <span>Get in touch</span> <span class="zmdi icon icon--btn-right" aria-hidden=true></span> </a></div></div><div class=cta-block__media><div class=cta-block__media-wrap><picture class=cta-block__picture><source media=(max-width:767px) srcset="/media/5fqlv1qh/marc.webp?rxy=0.4605512147429973,0.45243962167107216&amp;width=460&amp;height=308&amp;v=1dc338b621227e0&amp;format=webp"><img loading=lazy class=cta-block__image src="/media/5fqlv1qh/marc.webp?rxy=0.4605512147429973,0.45243962167107216&amp;width=1165&amp;v=1dc338b621227e0&amp;format=webp" alt=""> </picture></div></div></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=footer><div class=footer__top><div class=wrap><div class=footer__top-wrap><div class=footer__overview><a class=footer__logo-holder href="/" aria-label="Home page link"> <img class=footer__logo src="/media/bdyfw1yz/braemar-logo-dark.png?format=webp" alt=""> </a><div class="footer__text rte"><p class=text-large>Built on experience.&nbsp;Driven by insight.</div></div><ul class="footer__col footer__nav" aria-label="Quick Links"><li class=footer__col-title>Quick Links<li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/"> Home </a><li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/about-us/"> About Us </a><li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/services/"> Services </a><li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/investors/"> Investors </a><li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/careers/"> Careers </a><li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/sustainability/"> Sustainability </a><li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/news-insights/"> News &amp; Insights </a><li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/contacts/"> Contacts </a></ul><ul class="footer__col footer__tools" aria-label="Site Tools"><li class=footer__col-